SUMMARY:Gospel Night w/ Tyreese Hall & The Golden Stars
DESCRIPTION:Thursday April 23 | 9pm | $10 \n\n\n\n\n\n\nTyreese Hall & The Golden Stars is a musical group known for their contributions to gospel music. They blend traditional gospel sounds with contemporary influences\, appealing to a wide audience. \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\nThe Double Crown – Great vibes\, great bourbon\, and great music! (21+ only\, dog friendly) A West Asheville institution\, the Double Crown hosts Western Wednesdays\, karaoke\, DJ’s and rousing Gospel & Soul night’s each month. It’s a great place for an intimate evening of dancing\, drinks and fun\, especially if you love a good dive bar.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/gospel-night-w-tyreese-hall-the-golden-stars/
LOCATION:The Double Crown West Asheville\, 375 West Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
